From 0b59166fa6c2f896c5b5f09c10a1798b4f7ad8a4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arena Agent <agent@arena.ai>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 09:38:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Open the panel on what it receives, and put the inbox in the
 phone topbar

* The Notifications tab is the admin's inbox, so it now opens on **Received**
  (the API's own events: new order, salon registration, subscription renewal,
  delivery-partner action, booking request). "All" and "Sent by admin" stay as
  secondary views, and the empty state says which feed is empty.
* The page title carries one line of explanation, so an admin knows the list is
  what the panel received and that opening the tab marks it read.
* On a phone, a **bell beside the profile button** in the topbar opens the
  Notifications tab and carries the same unread badge (99+ cap, hidden once the
  tab is opened). It is only rendered for a role that can open the tab.
---
 src/components/Layout.jsx       | 57 +++++++++++++++++++++++++--------
 src/pages/PushNotifications.jsx | 33 ++++++++++++++-----
 2 files changed, 69 insertions(+), 21 deletions(-)

